# Chase Inspiration on Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2); Bot2 responds with Lightning Bolt, before the +0/+3 exists. The Ornithopter
# dies, the spell's only target is illegal and it does nothing (CR 608.2b): it goes to the graveyard without resolving.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Chase Inspiration
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Chase Inspiration.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Chase Inspiration; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
